{"id":"644066","name":"香菜拌羊脸","author":"宁静致远0217","authorId":"9691953","desc":"","cover":"images/644066/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"羊头肉","amount":"1/3个"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"3棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱白","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"羊头肉准备。","img":"images/644066/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成块。","img":"images/644066/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中放水煮羊头肉至出浮沫。","img":"images/644066/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撇干净浮沫。","img":"images/644066/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将羊头肉中的耳朵，口条，羊脸儿等拿出一部分凉凉。","img":"images/644066/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香菜去根洗净，切成段，葱白切丝。","img":"images/644066/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"羊头肉切丝，放入碗中，葱白香菜也放入碗中。","img":"images/644066/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入生抽盐，白糖，醋，辣椒油。","img":"images/644066/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/644066/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}